	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 13th level, your social capital gains begin paying off. If you possess a Stronghold, you may increase its total size to the minimum of the next grade, or accept a parcel of 60 acres of undeveloped land within 5 miles of your stronghold. If you do not possess a stronghold, you instead gain the 60 acres and a fairly basic grade 4 rural stronghold, likely a village you must protect.</p>",
